From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spread-bread <lczyk@spread-bread>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] perf: trie path conflict check via CHISEL_HACKS

backport of canonical/chisel#302 onto v1.5.0: a trie-based path conflict
check in place of the quadratic glob / generate loop in Release.validate.
gated on CHISEL_HACKS=1; unset keeps upstream's loop.
